# CODEOWNERS — who must approve changes to account administration.
#
# The whole repo is guarded by the account administrators by default. Per-org
# membership files can additionally be owned by that org's designated admins so
# projects self-serve their own membership PRs (the guardrail/self-service split
# described in docs/peribolos-setup.md).
#
# Requires "Require review from Code Owners" in the main branch protection rule.

# Default: account administrators own everything not otherwise matched.
*                               @neonephos/account-administrators

# The automation itself (workflows, Makefile, scripts, safety rails) is
# admin-only — projects can change membership, not the engine.
/.github/workflows/             @neonephos/account-administrators
/Makefile                       @neonephos/account-administrators
/admin/                         @neonephos/account-administrators
/CODEOWNERS                     @neonephos/account-administrators

# Per-org config. Add one block per onboarded org; delegate to the org's own
# admin team here if/when you want them to self-approve membership PRs.
/orgs/neonephos/                @neonephos/account-administrators
